 "style": {
  "name": "traced-line + coded hatch",
  "description": "The original hand-drawn linework traced to smooth vector fills, keeping the marker's stroke-weight variation. Shading is redrawn in code as hand-style hatching (per-stroke angle jitter, wobble, ragged ends) at laser-safe spacing. Large solids get gap channels unless they are display lettering. Rules: every line >= 0.25 mm, every gap >= 0.30 mm, no islands < 0.09 mm2, at least 0.35 mm from the laser's burnt edge."
 }
}
